17Lands. draft/limited/pickbot/ratings/FDN.json,
draft/limited/pickbot/values/FDN-champion.json, the 17Lands-derived decks in
cmd/enginebench/testdata/decks, and dirac/testdata/bench and
dirac/oracle/testdata/slices derive from 17Lands public datasets
(https://www.17lands.com), licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes: per-card aggregates;
values fitted from simulated games; decks filtered by win-rate bucket.

MTGJSON. draft/limited/setdata/mtgjson and draft/limited/setdata/sets are trimmed
from MTGJSON (https://mtgjson.com, MIT, copyright Zachary Halpern); see
draft/limited/setdata/mtgjson/LICENSE-MTGJSON.txt.

XMage. engine/rules/testdata/sets and dirac/cardset/setlists list card names taken
from manifests derived from XMage (MIT, https://github.com/magefree/mage); see
gorge-compliance's NOTICE.

mtg-kernel. bots/spellbench/decks/pauper-kernel and
cmd/enginebench/testdata/decks/burn.json derive from the SpellBench pauper deck
catalog in jackmaiorino/mtg-kernel (MIT, https://github.com/jackmaiorino/mtg-kernel),
data/pauper_pool_v1.json.

